div class=\"guanggao\" style=\"text-align: center;padding-bottom: 20px;\">\n<script>SG_GG(206940)\n</script><div id=\"SG_GG_CONTAINER_206940\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"guanggao\" style=\"padding-bottom: 20px;\">\n<div id=\"carousel-banner\" class=\"carousel slide carousel-vertical\" data-ride=\"carousel\" data-interval=\"3000\">\n<div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n<div class=\"item active\">\n<a target=\"_blank\">\n<img src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2023/03/08/img_pic_571678243954.png\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<a target=\"_blank\">\n<img src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2025/04/07/img_pic_73167824404612.png\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<a target=\"_blank\">\n<img src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2025/04/07/img_pic_93167824404012.png\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<a target=\"_blank\">\n<img src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2023/03/21/img_pic_931679381346.jpg\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<a target=\"_blank\">\n<img src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2024/08/05/img_pic_341722839675.gif\">\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"general-content-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"general-content-title\">蚂蚁集团组建AIRS整合搜广推能力，AI全面接管内容业务</div>\n<div class=\"general-content-info\">\n<div class=\"display-flex\">\n<div class=\"general-info-left\"> 2025-10-17 09:12:14</div>\n<div class=\"display-flex general-info-right\">\n<div class=\"display-flex\">\n<span class=\"icon iconfont iconchakan\" style=\"margin-right: 5px\"></span>\n<span id=\"read_count\">377348</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bdsharebuttonbox display-flex general-info-share hidden-xs bdshare-button-style0-16\" id=\"\">\n<span>分享到</span>\n<a href=\"#\" class=\"bds_weixin\" data-cmd=\"weixin\" title=\"分享到微信\" onclick=\"generatePostcard()\"></a>\n<a href=\"#\" class=\"bds_sqq\" data-cmd=\"sqq\" title=\"分享到QQ\" onclick=\"generatePostcard()\"></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"general-article\" id=\"content\">\n<p>10月16日消息，蚂蚁集团宣布重大组织架构调整，将搜索、广告、推荐（简称 “搜广推”）的工程与算法团队合并，成立全新的「AIRS」部门。该部门将全面承接短视频、短剧、直播等所有内容相关业务，标志着蚂蚁内容生态正式从传统的产品、运营驱动模式，转向以AI技术为核心的发展新路径。</p>\n<p>此次架构整合并非孤立动作，而是蚂蚁深化“AI First”战略的关键布局。事实上，蚂蚁此前已在AI领域积累了扎实的技术底座，其自主研发的推荐平台Arec已实现百万级QPS峰值流量承载能力，通过<span class=\"\">Serverless</span>化演进解决了多业务隔离与资源高效利用的行业痛点。</p> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tags\" style=\"margin: 30px 0;\">\n<!--?//= _STATIC ?-->\n</div>\n<div class=\"info-section-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n<span class=\"title\">最新文章</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"list-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"normal-item col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-6 \n                                col-xs-12\">\n<a href=\"https://www.donews.com/news/detail/1/6577365.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n<div class=\"recommend-image-cover\">\n<img class=\"recommend-image\" src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2025/03/20/img_pic_1742457699.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1000\" alt=\"消息称追觅开放融资，单笔投资门槛最低3.5亿\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"type\">\n<span class=\"icon iconfont iconchanpin\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 1px\">商业</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"title\">\n消息称追觅开放融资，单笔投资门槛最低3.5亿 </span>\n<span class=\"desc\">\n追觅开放Pre-IPO融资窗口，投前估值约700亿元，释放5%-10%份额，单笔门槛3.5亿元，含老股转让与新股增发。 </span>\n<div class=\"news-info\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"icon iconfont icontouxiang\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 5px\">吴丽</span>\n</div>\n<span>2小时前</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"normal-item col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-6 \n                                col-xs-12\">\n<a href=\"https://www.donews.com/news/detail/7/6577361.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n<div class=\"recommend-image-cover\">\n<img class=\"recommend-image\" src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2026/06/01/img_pic_741780292801.jpeg\" alt=\"零跑汽车5月交付达81569台，持续领跑\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"type\">\n<span class=\"icon iconfont iconchanpin\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 1px\">汽车</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"title\">\n零跑汽车5月交付达81569台，持续领跑 </span>\n<span class=\"desc\">\n零跑5月交付81569台，同比增长81%，创历史新高；A10单月交付破2万台，C系列累计超80万辆，全新C10/C11/C16即将上市。 </span>\n<div class=\"news-info\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"icon iconfont icontouxiang\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 5px\">杨亮</span>\n</div>\n<span>2小时前</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"normal-item col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-6 \n                                 col-xs-6\">\n<a href=\"https://www.donews.com/news/detail/1/6577349.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n<div class=\"recommend-image-cover\">\n<img class=\"recommend-image\" src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2026/06/01/img_pic_1780292682.png\" alt=\"英伟达 Isaac GR00T 人形机器人发布：基于宇树 H2 打造\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"type\">\n<span class=\"icon iconfont iconchanpin\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 1px\">商业</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"title\">\n英伟达 Isaac GR00T 人形机器人发布：基于宇树 H2 打造 </span>\n<span class=\"desc\">\n英伟达发布基于Jetson Thor和Isaac GR00T平台的开放式人形机器人参考设计，集成宇树H2 Plus与Sharpa Wave灵巧手，75 </span>\n<div class=\"news-info\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"icon iconfont icontouxiang\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 5px\">杨亮</span>\n</div>\n<span>2小时前</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"normal-item col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-6 \n                                 col-xs-6 hidden-xs\">\n<a href=\"https://www.donews.com/news/detail/1/6577342.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n<div class=\"recommend-image-cover\">\n<img class=\"recommend-image\" src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2026/06/01/img_pic_1780292482.png\" alt=\"天涯论坛总编喊话追觅俞浩，希望其接手社区\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"type\">\n<span class=\"icon iconfont iconchanpin\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 1px\">商业</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"title\">\n天涯论坛总编喊话追觅俞浩，希望其接手社区 </span>\n<span class=\"desc\">\n韩立勇称俞浩适合重启天涯：资金门槛低、控股难度小，其科技背景与天涯人文气质契合，2亿用户为不可复制的核心资产，有望打造差异化内容阵地。 </span>\n<div class=\"news-info\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"icon iconfont icontouxiang\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 5px\">杨亮</span>\n</div>\n<span>2小时前</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"normal-item col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-6 \n                                 col-xs-6 hidden-xs hidden-sm\">\n<a href=\"https://www.donews.com/news/detail/7/6577325.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n<div class=\"recommend-image-cover\">\n<img class=\"recommend-image\" src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2026/06/01/img_pic_1780292238.png\" alt=\"2026年最值得购买的B级插混SUV 比亚迪宋Ultra DM-i上市12.99万元起\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"type\">\n<span class=\"icon iconfont iconchanpin\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 1px\">汽车</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"title\">\n2026年最值得购买的B级插混SUV 比亚迪宋Ultra DM-i上市12.99万元起 </span>\n<span class=\"desc\">\n2026年最值得购买的B级插混SUV 比亚迪宋Ultra DM-i上市12.99万元起 </span>\n<div class=\"news-info\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"icon iconfont icontouxiang\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 5px\">大丽</span>\n</div>\n<span>2小时前</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"normal-item col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-6 \n                                 col-xs-6 hidden-xs hidden-sm\">\n<a href=\"https://www.donews.com/news/detail/1/6576922.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n<div class=\"recommend-image-cover\">\n<img class=\"recommend-image\" src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2026/06/01/img_pic_1780280667.png\" alt=\"S60的“星星海”，解不开vivo的僵局\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"type\">\n<span class=\"icon iconfont iconchanpin\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 1px\">商业</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"title\">\nS60的“星星海”，解不开vivo的僵局 </span>\n<span class=\"desc\">\nvivo的前路仍然布满荆棘 </span>\n<div class=\"news-info\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"icon iconfont icontouxiang\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 5px\">原创</span>\n</div>\n<span>5小时前</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"normal-item col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-6 \n                                 col-xs-6 hidden-xs hidden-sm hidden-max\">\n<a href=\"https://www.donews.com/news/detail/5/6576897.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n<div class=\"recommend-image-cover\">\n<img class=\"recommend-image\" src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2024/07/05/img_pic_1720164267.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1000\" alt=\"古尔曼：苹果智能眼镜推迟至 2027 年底发布\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"type\">\n<span class=\"icon iconfont iconchanpin\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 1px\">3C</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"title\">\n古尔曼：苹果智能眼镜推迟至 2027 年底发布 </span>\n<span class=\"desc\">\n苹果正研发智能眼镜，目标直指200–500美元传统眼镜市场，而非仅与Meta等竞争，看好其远超Apple Watch（年收170亿美元）的市场规模。 </span>\n<div class=\"news-info\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"icon iconfont icontouxiang\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 5px\">杨亮</span>\n</div>\n<span>5小时前</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"normal-item col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-6 \n                                 col-xs-6 hidden-xs hidden-sm hidden-max\">\n<a href=\"https://www.donews.com/news/detail/1/6576863.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n<div class=\"recommend-image-cover\">\n<img class=\"recommend-image\" src=\"https://img6.donews.com/img/2026/03/16/img_pic_1773631826_1401.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1000\" alt=\"MiniMax M3 发布，百万上下文、原生多模态\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"type\">\n<span class=\"icon iconfont iconchanpin\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 1px\">商业</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"title\">\nMiniMax M3 发布，百万上下文、原生多模态 </span>\n<span class=\"desc\">\nMiniMax M3是国产首个兼具前沿编码、百万上下文与原生多模态能力的旗舰模型，在智能体、长程推理和自主任务执行上达行业顶尖水平。 </span>\n<div class=\"news-info\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"icon iconfont icontouxiang\"></span>\n<span style=\"margin-left: 5px\">杨亮</span>\n</div>\n<span>6小时前</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dialog-pic-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"dialog-pic\">\n<div class=\"dialog-pic-header\">\n<a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"closePostcard()\" class=\"dialog-pic-close\">\n<svg t=\"1729739525278\" class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"3700\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\">\n<path d=\"M570.88 512L925.44 157.44a41.6 41.6 0 0 0-58.88-58.88L512 453.12 15